WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.835
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.105 --> 00:02.625
Maybe forgetting me

3
00:02.705 --> 00:06.105
would be better than having to hate someone as awful as me.

4
00:06.185 --> 00:08.825
Finito amora!

5
01:05.705 --> 01:06.585
Khobfa.

6
01:07.625 --> 01:09.105
Why did you give me my bracelet back?

7
01:12.345 --> 01:13.905
Wait.

8
01:16.585 --> 01:18.785
You remember me?

9
01:19.665 --> 01:20.825
Of course I do.

10
01:22.705 --> 01:23.745
Really?

11
01:24.985 --> 01:27.225
Then do you remember what I did to you?

12
01:29.425 --> 01:32.945
After what you did to me, how could I ever forget?

13
01:36.265 --> 01:37.265
Khobfa.

14
01:39.585 --> 01:42.865
Do you know the kind of person I hate the most?

15
01:44.505 --> 01:47.905
Someone who does something wrong but won't own up to it.

16
01:47.985 --> 01:50.825
Someone who's been lying to me all this time like you.

17
01:51.985 --> 01:53.065
Mark my words.

18
01:53.785 --> 01:55.865
I'll hate you forever.

19
03:09.225 --> 03:11.825
I hate people who do something wrong but won't own up to it.

20
03:11.905 --> 03:14.625
Someone who's been lying to me all this time like you.

21
03:15.225 --> 03:16.985
I'll hate you forever.

22
03:26.465 --> 03:27.865
How are you holding up?

23
03:27.945 --> 03:29.745
We're here to take you to class.

24
03:30.585 --> 03:33.185
I'm not feeling well. I don't think I'll go.

25
03:34.025 --> 03:38.425
Hey, you can't keep hiding forever.

26
03:41.585 --> 03:45.225
How am I supposed to face everyone after the shit I've done?

27
03:46.785 --> 03:48.785
Hey, don't worry.

28
03:48.865 --> 03:50.065
We've got your back.

29
03:53.425 --> 03:54.465
But…

30
03:56.105 --> 03:59.865
Or are you afraid to face Khobfa?

31
04:01.065 --> 04:02.585
That's not an issue.

32
04:03.265 --> 04:05.065
Khobfa doesn't remember me anymore.

33
04:06.865 --> 04:07.785
Why?

34
04:17.145 --> 04:18.905
I broke the curse.

35
04:20.265 --> 04:22.064
Khobfa doesn't remember me anymore.

36
04:23.225 --> 04:24.265
Damn, Rin.

37
04:26.985 --> 04:28.665
You never know.

38
04:28.745 --> 04:31.505
Maybe the curse wasn't even real.

39
04:33.225 --> 04:35.905
He might still remember you.

40
04:51.505 --> 04:53.545
Hey, I forgot to get something.

41
04:53.625 --> 04:56.385
I'll go buy it. Wait here. We'll head up to class together.

42
04:56.465 --> 04:57.545
Come on, Ohm.

43
04:57.625 --> 04:58.985
-Me? -Come with me.

44
05:07.025 --> 05:07.945
Hey.

45
05:25.865 --> 05:28.385
Maybe the curse wasn't even real.

46
05:28.985 --> 05:31.585
Khobfa might still remember you.

47
05:41.705 --> 05:42.945
Watch where you're going.

48
05:50.825 --> 05:51.865
Shit.

49
05:52.465 --> 05:56.105
Khobfa really doesn't remember you after all that time you spent together.

50
06:02.505 --> 06:03.865
Okay, that's all for today.

51
06:03.945 --> 06:07.705
-See you next time. Goodbye. -Goodbye.

52
06:28.505 --> 06:29.625
It's okay, man.

53
06:30.705 --> 06:34.185
All they can do is talk. They can't do anything to us.

54
06:34.265 --> 06:36.945
Exactly. This is not a big deal.

55
06:37.025 --> 06:38.505
People will forget soon enough.

56
06:38.585 --> 06:40.745
Krit and Mochi are lucky they didn't show up today.

57
06:40.825 --> 06:42.585
I would've punched them.

58
06:42.665 --> 06:44.865
Yeah, I would've punched them too.

59
06:44.945 --> 06:46.265
Great job.

60
06:46.345 --> 06:47.225
Nice.

61
06:52.065 --> 06:57.025
Khobfa really doesn't remember you after all that time you spent together.

62
07:01.345 --> 07:02.225
Hello, guys.

63
07:04.505 --> 07:05.785
Hi.

64
07:05.865 --> 07:08.305
Khobfa, you remember us?

65
07:08.385 --> 07:12.665
Of course I do. I don't have amnesia.

66
07:12.745 --> 07:14.305
See you in the rehearsal room.

67
07:14.385 --> 07:15.465
-Yeah. -Yeah.

68
07:15.545 --> 07:17.025
Hey, wait.

69
07:17.105 --> 07:19.505
You remember the band competition too?

70
07:20.585 --> 07:23.105
What's with you? We made it through the first round together.

71
07:23.185 --> 07:24.585
Of course I remember.

72
07:24.665 --> 07:27.265
The final competition is coming up. Make sure you practice hard.

73
07:27.345 --> 07:32.025
Wait. If you really remember, name everyone in the band.

74
07:34.065 --> 07:37.225
What is it now? Well, there's you two.

75
07:37.865 --> 07:39.065
Then me,

76
07:40.425 --> 07:41.865
and…

77
07:49.145 --> 07:50.865
Danthai. Four of us.

78
07:50.945 --> 07:54.145
Is that really all you remember? What about…

79
07:55.705 --> 07:56.945
Hey.

80
08:05.985 --> 08:07.225
Your shoelace is untied.

81
08:20.785 --> 08:23.185
So you're really the only one he doesn't remember, Rin.

82
08:23.265 --> 08:24.505
Yeah, seriously.

83
08:24.585 --> 08:27.385
Do we still have to compete in the competition?

84
08:27.465 --> 08:29.745
Hey, you have to keep going.

85
08:30.785 --> 08:32.904
You have to lead the band to victory.

86
08:38.545 --> 08:43.305
I just want Khobfa to finally see his dream come true just once.

87
08:51.905 --> 08:54.785
Mochi, please open the door.

88
08:57.505 --> 08:59.825
I know you heard me. Open the door.

89
09:05.905 --> 09:06.785
Mochi.

90
09:08.745 --> 09:09.625
Mochi.

91
09:21.905 --> 09:23.385
Hi, everyone.

92
09:24.745 --> 09:26.225
I'm Mochi.

93
09:31.345 --> 09:33.105
I'm going live today

94
09:34.625 --> 09:36.465
to apologize to someone.

95
09:36.545 --> 09:37.625
Hey.

96
09:37.705 --> 09:39.065
-What are you watching? -Mochi's live.

97
09:40.345 --> 09:41.705
Someone I feel…

98
09:44.585 --> 09:46.585
really guilty about hurting.

99
09:47.865 --> 09:52.465
But I don't know if he'll forgive me.

100
09:59.745 --> 10:00.625
Rin.

101
10:02.825 --> 10:04.665
I'm really sorry.

102
10:06.305 --> 10:09.985
I'm the one who edited the clip to make it look worse than it was.

103
10:10.585 --> 10:12.705
Then I gave the file to the staff team.

104
10:12.785 --> 10:16.585
I just wanted you to hurt the way I did

105
10:17.385 --> 10:19.705
when you betrayed me by getting together with Krit.

106
10:21.465 --> 10:23.865
I just wanted to teach you a lesson.

107
10:25.345 --> 10:28.145
But I never thought it would hurt you this badly.

108
10:38.105 --> 10:39.745
I'm really sorry.

109
11:06.585 --> 11:10.705
THE WINNERS OF THE UNIVERSITY'S 2026 KOL CONTEST

110
11:31.185 --> 11:32.345
Congratulations.

111
11:34.145 --> 11:35.665
I'm sorry…

112
11:39.425 --> 11:41.345
for ruining your life like that.

113
11:48.825 --> 11:53.465
Some good actually came out of it.

114
11:54.665 --> 11:58.985
It helped me decide to do something I should've done a long time ago.

115
12:00.305 --> 12:01.425
I was…

116
12:02.985 --> 12:04.505
so damn selfish.

117
12:07.025 --> 12:08.065
So…

118
12:09.305 --> 12:11.545
I should probably thank you for that clip.

119
12:12.945 --> 12:17.945
It pushed me to make things right,

120
12:18.625 --> 12:23.025
removing something bad from Khobfa's life.

121
12:35.345 --> 12:37.065
Remember back in high school?

122
12:38.705 --> 12:40.785
We made a rule for our group.

123
12:42.345 --> 12:44.545
We'd stay strong in front of the rest of the world.

124
12:46.185 --> 12:48.865
But with each other, we could let our guard down

125
12:51.545 --> 12:52.665
because…

126
12:53.865 --> 12:55.345
-we're friends. -We're friends.

127
13:07.585 --> 13:09.345
You don't have to be strong around me…

128
13:12.705 --> 13:13.545
my friend.

129
13:37.665 --> 13:39.025
Ow! Shit!

130
13:54.305 --> 13:55.665
You again?

131
13:55.745 --> 13:57.625
Why do I keep running into you?

132
13:57.705 --> 13:59.305
Got feelings for me or something?

133
14:00.665 --> 14:01.505
Huh?

134
14:01.585 --> 14:02.665
No.

135
14:08.025 --> 14:08.985
Wait.

136
14:31.665 --> 14:32.745
Thanks a lot.

137
14:35.065 --> 14:36.265
That was close.

138
14:36.345 --> 14:40.145
If I'd lost this, I wouldn't have been able to sleep.

139
14:43.145 --> 14:44.385
Is it pretty?

140
14:46.745 --> 14:50.305
Yeah, it is.

141
14:51.545 --> 14:53.865
I feel really attached to it.

142
14:55.745 --> 14:57.105
Who gave it to me?

143
15:10.825 --> 15:13.425
Hey! My clothes!

144
15:13.505 --> 15:15.785
Hey, where are you taking them?

145
15:19.625 --> 15:20.665
Here.

146
15:22.305 --> 15:23.825
Hurry up and get on.

147
15:23.905 --> 15:25.745
Come on. I'll give you a ride.

148
15:33.505 --> 15:37.025
Maybe it is better that Khobfa has forgotten me.

149
15:38.265 --> 15:40.345
If it means he won't have bad luck anymore,

150
15:42.825 --> 15:44.385
then I think it's worth it.

151
15:59.505 --> 16:00.505
I'm sorry.

152
16:01.305 --> 16:03.585
Hold on tight. Don't fall off again.

153
16:04.185 --> 16:06.065
Why does this route feel so familiar?

154
16:06.625 --> 16:08.385
It's like I used to come this way all the time.

155
16:09.865 --> 16:12.945
These streets all look alike.

156
16:13.025 --> 16:14.785
Turn left over there.

157
16:16.825 --> 16:17.705
Turn left.

158
16:27.905 --> 16:29.225
Here, let me help.

159
16:29.305 --> 16:30.625
Hey, you don't have to.

160
16:30.705 --> 16:31.705
Let me do it.

161
16:38.905 --> 16:42.385
Why does this feel so familiar? It's like I've dropped someone off here before.

162
16:44.825 --> 16:45.985
Really?

163
16:46.745 --> 16:47.905
What's your name again?

164
16:51.545 --> 16:52.385
Rin.

165
16:54.225 --> 16:55.305
I'm Khobfa.

166
16:56.145 --> 16:57.265
Nice to meet you.

167
17:00.585 --> 17:01.985
Nice to meet you…

168
17:03.705 --> 17:04.865
Khobfa.

169
17:14.905 --> 17:15.825
I'll get going.

170
17:17.704 --> 17:18.905
That goes for you too.

171
17:19.545 --> 17:20.625
About Khobfa.

172
17:20.704 --> 17:23.105
You still have the right to love him.

173
17:23.704 --> 17:25.305
If you can forgive me,

174
17:27.905 --> 17:29.705
I think Khobfa can forgive you too.

175
17:38.865 --> 17:39.985
Hey, wait.

176
17:40.865 --> 17:42.065
My stuff.

177
17:42.145 --> 17:44.785
Oh, I almost forgot.

178
17:46.545 --> 17:47.385
Here.

179
17:58.705 --> 17:59.545
Thanks.

180
18:00.545 --> 18:01.385
Yeah.

181
18:10.745 --> 18:14.905
So you're saying Khobfa ran into you and then gave you a ride here?

182
18:14.985 --> 18:17.225
-That's one hell of a coincidence. -Right?

183
18:18.785 --> 18:22.945
It's like I'm starting over with the same person.

184
18:23.025 --> 18:24.745
I'm rooting for you, Rin.

185
18:26.265 --> 18:27.905
What good would starting over do?

186
18:28.785 --> 18:33.865
I'd still have to tell him the truth about what I did to him.

187
18:34.985 --> 18:36.625
Then just tell him yourself.

188
18:37.825 --> 18:39.225
Tell him you're sorry.

189
18:39.905 --> 18:41.985
Maybe Khobfa will forgive you.

190
18:47.265 --> 18:48.945
And what if he doesn't?

191
18:54.305 --> 18:56.065
I'd rather he forgot me

192
18:57.185 --> 18:58.905
than hate me.

193
19:13.705 --> 19:15.465
Finally, you show up.

194
19:16.065 --> 19:18.825
It's good you came. I have to clear things up with you.

195
19:20.465 --> 19:23.505
So do I. You go first.

196
19:24.825 --> 19:26.825
I think it's time we ended things between us.

197
19:28.225 --> 19:30.825
We won the university's KOL contest.

198
19:31.865 --> 19:33.185
So I guess our mission is done.

199
19:36.345 --> 19:37.185
Mochi.

200
19:38.185 --> 19:40.745
What about our band?

201
19:42.065 --> 19:43.825
I've damaged the band's reputation.

202
19:43.905 --> 19:46.465
Replace me with whoever you want. I won't object.

203
19:48.505 --> 19:49.385
Mochi.

204
19:53.345 --> 19:56.065
I've said what I needed to say. You can leave now.

205
19:58.345 --> 20:01.225
And let's not see each other anymore.

206
20:10.905 --> 20:13.265
Aren't you going to hear what I have to say?

207
20:15.785 --> 20:16.865
What is it?

208
20:19.625 --> 20:21.305
I saw your apology video to Rin.

209
20:28.585 --> 20:30.265
You've sorted things out with him.

210
20:30.865 --> 20:31.825
As for the band,

211
20:33.825 --> 20:34.865
you're staying.

212
20:36.665 --> 20:37.505
Krit,

213
20:38.585 --> 20:42.105
why would you want to keep me after the shit I did?

214
20:42.185 --> 20:43.785
What if your band loses because of me?

215
20:45.065 --> 20:46.065
I don't know.

216
20:48.625 --> 20:50.385
You talked me into starting a band.

217
20:50.465 --> 20:52.265
Now we've made it to the final round.

218
20:52.345 --> 20:55.345
You're responsible for it. Look after our band until the end.

219
20:57.345 --> 20:58.705
But I…

220
21:03.625 --> 21:04.825
You can't quit.

221
21:28.065 --> 21:30.665
KHOBFA'S BIRTHDAY FINAL ROUND

222
21:34.785 --> 21:36.225
VICTORY

223
21:36.305 --> 21:37.585
Hey!

224
21:38.385 --> 21:39.745
You scared me.

225
21:39.825 --> 21:42.225
Are you really not coming to watch?

226
21:43.105 --> 21:46.345
I think I'd better not. There's someone I don't want to see.

227
21:46.425 --> 21:48.145
But it's the final round.

228
21:48.225 --> 21:49.505
Exactly.

229
21:49.585 --> 21:53.345
You can still change your mind, Rin. You built this band from scratch.

230
21:53.425 --> 21:54.625
That's right.

231
21:58.025 --> 21:59.665
I'll watch the live stream.

232
22:01.265 --> 22:06.185
I'll be cheering you on from here. You guys can do this. Trust me.

233
22:06.265 --> 22:10.585
Oh, and remind everyone in the band to wear the shirts I had made.

234
22:10.665 --> 22:12.185
Every single member, okay?

235
22:12.265 --> 22:13.425
Yes, sir.

236
22:17.145 --> 22:18.225
Come on. Bring it in.

237
22:18.305 --> 22:19.585
Let's get fired up.

238
22:19.665 --> 22:20.905
Horizon!

239
22:21.785 --> 22:23.345
Yeah.

240
22:24.665 --> 22:27.425
-Horizon, let's go! -Horizon, let's go!

241
22:31.745 --> 22:32.785
THE 5 FINALIST BANDS!

242
22:32.865 --> 22:34.745
SAKIT, FRIENDS WITH DEADLINES, STAND STILL, HORIZON, THE WINNER

243
22:49.905 --> 22:51.865
I still can't reach Khobfa.

244
22:51.945 --> 22:54.145
Just calm down.

245
22:54.225 --> 22:56.225
He had something to take care of. He'll be here soon.

246
22:58.505 --> 23:00.265
Good luck, guys.

247
23:02.065 --> 23:03.865
Don't try to butter us up, Mochi.

248
23:04.465 --> 23:07.025
Rin may have told us you two have sorted things out,

249
23:07.105 --> 23:08.625
but I won't forgive you that easily.

250
23:09.225 --> 23:13.745
Yeah. After what you did to our friend, you won't get our forgiveness that easily.

251
23:13.825 --> 23:19.585
I've set myself a minimum of 10,000 hours to stay mad at you.

252
23:19.665 --> 23:20.625
Remember that.

253
23:22.225 --> 23:24.465
Yeah. I'll make sure I never forget.

254
23:25.665 --> 23:29.065
Where's Khobfa? I wanted to wish him luck.

255
23:29.665 --> 23:32.265
He's on his way. He said he'd be a little late.

256
23:32.345 --> 23:34.185
He's taking his time, huh?

257
23:35.505 --> 23:38.225
It's almost time. Let's get ready.

258
23:44.585 --> 23:47.505
So what now? What is Khobfa off doing?

259
23:57.225 --> 23:58.865
Tell him you're sorry.

260
23:58.945 --> 24:01.025
Maybe Khobfa will forgive you.

261
24:01.105 --> 24:02.305
Mark my words.

262
24:03.065 --> 24:05.105
I'll hate you forever.

263
24:12.905 --> 24:13.825
Rin!

264
24:15.305 --> 24:16.145
Mom!

265
24:16.865 --> 24:18.225
Hi, son!

266
24:19.305 --> 24:20.225
Hungry?

267
24:20.305 --> 24:21.865
Come and eat.

268
24:23.905 --> 24:24.745
Thanks.

269
24:26.985 --> 24:30.585
Why did you come back, Mom? I thought you were heading to Tibet next.

270
24:31.625 --> 24:35.025
Something told me I should come back to see you.

271
24:37.065 --> 24:40.465
Now, give Ms. Daran a little recap.

272
24:40.545 --> 24:43.345
How's life treating Mr. Darin?

273
24:52.465 --> 24:53.345
Mom.

274
24:54.345 --> 24:55.225
Yeah?

275
24:56.545 --> 24:58.425
I have something to confess.

276
25:00.385 --> 25:03.825
When I called you about lifting that curse,

277
25:04.345 --> 25:05.825
actually…

278
25:09.465 --> 25:10.945
I was the one who cast it.

279
25:14.945 --> 25:18.345
When you said your friend had cursed the wrong person?

280
25:19.225 --> 25:20.065
Yes.

281
25:22.145 --> 25:25.385
And how do you feel about it now?

282
25:33.025 --> 25:34.705
Terrible.

283
25:37.105 --> 25:40.865
I tried to make up for what I'd done.

284
25:42.985 --> 25:47.145
I found a way to get close to him and hide everything from him.

285
25:51.265 --> 25:53.625
But he was so good to me.

286
25:56.905 --> 26:01.105
We started having feelings for each other.

287
26:04.385 --> 26:08.225
But then something happened.

288
26:09.465 --> 26:11.185
Is what you said

289
26:12.145 --> 26:13.705
in that video true?

290
26:15.225 --> 26:16.865
He found out the truth,

291
26:18.345 --> 26:22.585
so I decided to lift the curse

292
26:22.665 --> 26:25.625
even though it meant he'd forget everything we'd been through.

293
26:28.065 --> 26:30.025
It might sound selfish,

294
26:33.465 --> 26:34.785
but I just…

295
26:37.665 --> 26:40.905
I was just scared that if he remembered me…

296
26:43.665 --> 26:45.025
he'd hate me.

297
26:49.345 --> 26:51.425
I sound awful, don't I, Mom?

298
27:01.585 --> 27:02.745
A little.

299
27:06.385 --> 27:11.065
Good thing my son is so handsome.

300
27:11.145 --> 27:13.145
That makes you a little less awful.

301
27:24.225 --> 27:25.105
Here you are.

302
27:30.025 --> 27:33.545
There's one thing I want to tell you.

303
27:34.145 --> 27:35.505
If you get the chance,

304
27:38.465 --> 27:40.625
you should tell him the truth.

305
27:41.985 --> 27:44.025
But what if I tell him

306
27:45.625 --> 27:47.505
and he doesn't forgive me?

307
27:53.465 --> 27:55.905
At least you'll be able to forgive yourself,

308
27:56.945 --> 27:58.265
unlike me.

309
27:58.985 --> 28:01.745
I've been living with guilt all this time.

310
28:05.265 --> 28:09.785
Your dad didn't actually die in an accident.

311
28:11.065 --> 28:13.025
He probably couldn't accept

312
28:13.105 --> 28:17.105
that I'd taken over your grandma's spiritual practice.

313
28:18.585 --> 28:20.705
That's why he left us.

314
28:25.265 --> 28:27.345
I wasn't that concerned about him.

315
28:27.945 --> 28:29.505
You were the one…

316
28:33.745 --> 28:34.785
I cared about.

317
28:36.465 --> 28:39.985
So I decided not to tell you the truth…

318
28:43.225 --> 28:45.785
because I was afraid you'd hate me.

319
28:46.825 --> 28:47.745
Mom.

320
28:49.545 --> 28:52.865
The more afraid I was that you'd hate me…

321
28:59.065 --> 29:02.185
the more I hated myself.

322
29:02.865 --> 29:04.825
I'm sorry, Rin.

323
29:06.265 --> 29:09.345
I'm sorry I've been lying to you all this time.

324
29:17.425 --> 29:18.705
Mom.

325
29:20.025 --> 29:22.105
You don't have to feel guilty anymore.

326
29:25.185 --> 29:26.905
I like who I am.

327
29:27.985 --> 29:29.825
I love our family just as it is.

328
29:32.865 --> 29:37.385
Not once, Mom, have I ever felt unloved.

329
29:39.505 --> 29:42.385
You're the best mom in the world, you know that?

330
29:47.625 --> 29:48.825
I love you, Mom.

331
30:14.545 --> 30:16.505
I love you too, sweetheart.

332
30:18.785 --> 30:22.705
If you're not mad that I spoke the truth,

333
30:25.465 --> 30:30.665
I believe Khobfa will understand what you've done.

334
30:35.785 --> 30:39.385
So, what are you still sitting here for?

335
30:39.465 --> 30:41.665
Hurry up and go see Khobfa.

336
30:42.945 --> 30:44.145
You're right, Mom.

337
30:45.545 --> 30:49.705
If I leave now, I should still make it.

338
30:52.545 --> 30:55.225
I'll get going, then. I love you, Mom.

339
30:56.825 --> 30:59.545
Wait! Don't go yet. Hold on, sweetheart.

340
30:59.625 --> 31:02.265
You don't have to worry about the curse in that book anymore.

341
31:02.345 --> 31:04.545
None of it is real.

342
31:04.625 --> 31:07.305
Huh? That owl spellbook?

343
31:07.385 --> 31:08.705
It's a mock-up.

344
31:08.785 --> 31:12.305
I thought it was cute, so I bought it for you.

345
31:12.385 --> 31:16.305
What about that conversation I overheard you and Grandma having?

346
31:16.385 --> 31:18.505
About me inheriting the spiritual gifts?

347
31:19.425 --> 31:23.185
Grandma meant Danthai, sweetheart.

348
31:23.265 --> 31:24.105
What?

349
31:25.025 --> 31:28.025
But if the curse wasn't real,

350
31:28.105 --> 31:31.785
why couldn't Khobfa remember me after I lifted it?

351
31:31.865 --> 31:33.705
I can't tell you that.

352
31:33.785 --> 31:36.625
You'll have to ask Khobfa yourself.

353
31:43.345 --> 31:47.065
It's still you, as it's always been

354
31:47.145 --> 31:51.225
It's only you, and it'll forever be

355
31:51.305 --> 31:57.265
The emptier I feel The more I yearn for you

356
31:57.345 --> 31:59.225
How's everything going, guys? Where's Khobfa?

357
31:59.305 --> 32:01.785
We have no idea where Khobfa went. I tried calling, but his phone's off.

358
32:01.865 --> 32:02.825
What?

359
32:02.905 --> 32:05.185
We're supposed to play right after Krit's band.

360
32:05.265 --> 32:06.825
Is Khobfa really abandoning us?

361
32:08.865 --> 32:12.745
This song still resonates in my heart

362
32:35.145 --> 32:40.265
And that was the Winner!

363
32:42.705 --> 32:43.745
How did you feel?

364
32:43.825 --> 32:47.505
Wow, I felt that performance resonate in my heart.

365
32:47.585 --> 32:49.785
-They really gave it their all. -Yes.

366
32:53.865 --> 32:56.905
And now, it's time for our final band of the final round.

367
32:56.985 --> 33:00.665
-Let's hear it for Horizon! -Horizon!

368
33:06.985 --> 33:11.225
A round of applause for Horizon!

369
33:17.745 --> 33:19.745
Let's set up the equipment while we wait.

370
33:19.825 --> 33:21.825
Yeah. Let's get it ready.

371
33:29.225 --> 33:30.505
Where is he?

372
33:33.585 --> 33:35.865
It's their turn already, isn't it?

373
33:35.945 --> 33:38.225
Yeah. They're going onstage any minute now.

374
33:38.305 --> 33:39.945
The singer hasn't arrived?

375
33:53.825 --> 33:56.705
-How did he get onstage? -Yeah, exactly.

376
33:56.785 --> 33:58.385
Where's the actual singer?

377
33:58.905 --> 34:00.705
Wait, who's this guy?

378
34:00.785 --> 34:02.265
I've never seen him before.

379
34:02.825 --> 34:04.985
Then why is he up there?

380
34:05.505 --> 34:07.585
Did they change singers at the last minute?

381
34:07.665 --> 34:09.185
I don't think so.

382
34:09.705 --> 34:11.304
Then where did the singer go?

383
34:12.304 --> 34:13.304
Khobfa!

384
34:14.905 --> 34:16.105
Where are you?

385
34:17.865 --> 34:21.625
Are you not coming onstage because you're still mad at me?

386
34:22.784 --> 34:24.225
If you can hear me,

387
34:26.344 --> 34:28.185
there's something I want to tell you.

388
34:28.784 --> 34:31.185
Get up here and make your dream come true.

389
34:33.065 --> 34:34.304
I'm sorry…

390
34:36.344 --> 34:40.264
for everything I've done to you.

391
34:45.865 --> 34:48.385
If having me here makes you uncomfortable,

392
34:48.465 --> 34:50.264
I'll leave.

393
34:52.105 --> 34:53.585
But I want you to know that

394
34:54.264 --> 34:56.665
what we felt for each other…

395
34:59.505 --> 35:01.425
was real.

396
35:08.465 --> 35:09.985
I really love you,

397
35:11.465 --> 35:13.705
and it has nothing to do with any curse.

398
35:15.385 --> 35:17.505
Every moment we spent together…

399
35:20.385 --> 35:22.465
really made me happy.

400
35:24.185 --> 35:25.905
Please come up and sing.

401
35:27.625 --> 35:29.105
Come and sing your song.

402
35:31.785 --> 35:33.825
If the music and this band

403
35:33.905 --> 35:35.945
still mean something to you,

404
35:40.625 --> 35:42.745
please come up and sing.

405
35:55.345 --> 35:56.585
Well said, man!

406
35:59.545 --> 36:00.865
Khobfa!

407
36:02.065 --> 36:03.265
Can you hear him?

408
36:04.145 --> 36:05.505
Come on out!

409
36:07.545 --> 36:09.625
Khobfa!

410
36:09.705 --> 36:12.705
Khobfa!

411
36:12.785 --> 36:15.545
Khobfa!

412
36:15.625 --> 36:17.665
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

413
36:17.745 --> 36:19.465
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

414
36:19.545 --> 36:21.305
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

415
36:21.385 --> 36:24.505
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

416
36:24.585 --> 36:27.305
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

417
36:27.385 --> 36:30.625
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

418
36:30.705 --> 36:35.985
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

419
36:36.065 --> 36:39.225
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

420
36:39.305 --> 36:42.665
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

421
36:42.745 --> 36:46.745
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

422
36:46.825 --> 36:47.785
I still do!

423
37:13.065 --> 37:16.465
It's not just the music or the band I have feelings for.

424
37:18.705 --> 37:20.545
I have feelings for you too, Rin.

425
37:27.185 --> 37:29.585
Then why did you pretend you didn't remember me?

426
37:30.185 --> 37:32.665
I was afraid you'd get hurt even more, Rin.

427
37:34.905 --> 37:36.985
So I had to play along.

428
37:37.065 --> 37:39.105
I pretended I'd forgotten you.

429
37:41.305 --> 37:45.225
But I never forgot you, not even for a second.

430
37:46.745 --> 37:48.865
I kept trying to get close to you,

431
37:49.465 --> 37:52.825
hoping that one day, you'd want to tell me the truth,

432
37:54.425 --> 37:56.105
so we could start over.

433
38:11.105 --> 38:13.785
This next song…

434
38:14.905 --> 38:19.105
expresses everything I feel about you.

435
38:23.625 --> 38:27.385
Wake up to the same old things

436
38:27.465 --> 38:30.945
And the world is never kind

437
38:31.505 --> 38:34.465
Feels like I did some wrong things

438
38:34.545 --> 38:39.185
Even heaven's not on my side

439
38:39.265 --> 38:42.785
Everybody says that I

440
38:43.345 --> 38:46.825
Bring bad luck, whatever I try

441
38:47.425 --> 38:51.145
No one wants to stick around

442
38:51.225 --> 38:54.065
Or walk by my side

443
39:00.745 --> 39:04.665
Maybe I'm a man who is so unlucky

444
39:04.745 --> 39:08.505
Like I've been cursed And everything gets messy

445
39:08.585 --> 39:11.545
Whatever I do ends in heartache

446
39:11.625 --> 39:15.105
Disappointment is my only friend

447
39:16.425 --> 39:20.385
But there's still one thing That somehow turned out right

448
39:20.465 --> 39:24.545
Whatever comes I know you'll be there by my side

449
39:24.625 --> 39:27.305
No matter how unlucky life may be

450
39:27.385 --> 39:30.505
I've got one silver lining on my side

451
39:30.585 --> 39:34.905
I'm lucky enough to have you in my life

452
39:36.825 --> 39:40.585
From now on, whatever comes

453
39:40.665 --> 39:44.585
But if I have you close to me

454
39:44.665 --> 39:48.065
No matter how hard the road is

455
39:48.145 --> 39:52.185
I'll keep going if you walk with me

456
39:52.745 --> 39:56.505
Never ever thought that I

457
39:56.585 --> 40:00.025
Bring bad luck, whatever I try

458
40:00.585 --> 40:04.465
Could have you with me in my life

459
40:04.545 --> 40:07.545
Never leaving my side

460
40:07.625 --> 40:11.665
But there's still one thing That somehow turned out right

461
40:11.745 --> 40:15.385
Whatever comes I know you'll be there by my side

462
40:15.465 --> 40:18.465
No matter how unlucky life may be

463
40:18.545 --> 40:22.105
I've got one silver lining on my side

464
40:22.185 --> 40:28.225
I'm lucky enough to have you in my life

465
41:00.425 --> 41:04.865
If I had to live with bad luck without a single lucky break,

466
41:05.625 --> 41:06.825
I could live with that.

467
41:08.705 --> 41:10.865
But having bad luck

468
41:11.625 --> 41:12.905
and not having you?

469
41:13.705 --> 41:15.105
I couldn't live with that.

470
41:20.345 --> 41:22.545
I'm blushing for them.

471
41:23.865 --> 41:28.225
Will you finally take this unlucky guy as your boyfriend?

472
41:28.825 --> 41:31.945
There he goes.

473
41:47.985 --> 41:49.185
Of course!

474
41:55.185 --> 41:57.865
-They're so sweet together! -Aw!

475
42:02.825 --> 42:05.345
Thank you so much, little boy.

476
42:06.665 --> 42:08.185
You're so big, huh?

477
42:14.905 --> 42:18.305
We now have the results right here in our hands.

478
42:18.385 --> 42:22.465
The two bands with the highest scores are…

479
42:22.545 --> 42:26.465
-The Winner! -Sakit!

480
42:26.545 --> 42:28.625
The Winner!

481
42:33.705 --> 42:35.945
The Winner!

482
42:46.145 --> 42:48.265
And the other band is…

483
42:50.145 --> 42:52.705
SAKIT, HORIZON, STAND STILL, THE WINNER

484
42:52.785 --> 42:56.865
-Horizon! -Horizon!

485
42:58.265 --> 42:59.945
Horizon!

486
43:00.905 --> 43:01.865
Shit.

487
43:01.945 --> 43:03.505
We made it!

488
43:08.345 --> 43:10.425
That's amazing.

489
43:11.185 --> 43:16.345
And the champion of the Campus Stage 2026 is…

490
43:16.425 --> 43:19.465
SAKIT, HORIZON, STAND STILL, THE WINNER

491
43:19.545 --> 43:24.425
-The Winner! -The Winner!

492
43:32.065 --> 43:36.505
Horizon!

493
43:41.905 --> 43:45.625
May we invite the judges onstage to present the award, please?

494
43:49.825 --> 43:50.825
Congratulations.

495
43:54.265 --> 43:56.025
-Thank you. -Thank you.

496
44:00.385 --> 44:04.225
THE CAMPUS STAGE 100,000 BAHT

497
44:07.265 --> 44:09.345
THE 5 FINALIST BANDS!

498
44:11.905 --> 44:13.545
Thank you for coming to see us play,

499
44:14.425 --> 44:17.865
even though our band lost.

500
44:19.945 --> 44:21.385
You came second.

501
44:22.385 --> 44:24.225
You still beat plenty of other bands.

502
44:26.105 --> 44:26.985
Dad.

503
44:28.025 --> 44:29.105
You did well.

504
44:30.625 --> 44:32.345
Send me some clips, okay?

505
44:32.945 --> 44:34.585
I want to show them to my friends.

506
44:35.185 --> 44:36.025
Sure.

507
44:36.545 --> 44:38.465
Your dad cares a lot about you, Krit.

508
44:38.545 --> 44:40.305
He kept asking about you

509
44:40.385 --> 44:42.465
and secretly watching your rehearsal clips.

510
44:42.545 --> 44:44.705
That's enough. You talk too much.

511
44:46.505 --> 44:49.105
-Come on. Let's take a picture. -Come.

512
44:50.145 --> 44:51.505
I'll take it for you.

513
44:51.585 --> 44:52.905
No need.

514
44:52.985 --> 44:56.585
It's a family photo. Everyone has to be in it.

515
45:02.105 --> 45:05.545
Thank you so much for not giving up on my son.

516
45:08.985 --> 45:10.585
Come and join the photo.

517
45:12.305 --> 45:14.585
One, two, three.

518
45:14.665 --> 45:17.745
One, two, three. One more.

519
45:24.865 --> 45:26.545
Where the hell is Rin?

520
45:26.625 --> 45:28.505
He'll probably be here soon.

521
45:28.585 --> 45:30.985
Ohm, don't eat everything before he gets here.

522
45:32.545 --> 45:33.745
I know, I know.

523
45:35.185 --> 45:36.145
Hey, Khobfa.

524
45:36.225 --> 45:38.345
You can't stop smiling, huh?

525
45:39.265 --> 45:40.305
You keep smiling.

526
45:52.105 --> 45:52.945
Guys,

527
45:54.305 --> 45:56.825
can Krit and Mochi join us?

528
46:01.105 --> 46:05.345
Come on. The more, the merrier.

529
46:05.425 --> 46:07.185
Sure.

530
46:07.265 --> 46:08.305
There's plenty of room.

531
46:10.145 --> 46:11.705
Have a seat. I'll bring more chairs.

532
46:22.945 --> 46:26.425
You two, give them some time.

533
46:26.505 --> 46:28.745
They're not that mad at you.

534
46:28.825 --> 46:30.945
They're just acting tough. See?

535
46:37.945 --> 46:40.825
I won't let you eat this piece. If you want some, get another.

536
46:48.345 --> 46:49.545
This one too.

537
46:49.625 --> 46:50.905
Don't even think about it.

538
46:57.905 --> 46:59.185
What are you laughing at?

539
46:59.745 --> 47:01.025
What's so funny?

540
47:02.185 --> 47:03.025
Nothing.

541
47:04.385 --> 47:05.985
I was just thinking.

542
47:06.065 --> 47:10.145
I'm glad Rin has friends like you guys.

543
47:10.985 --> 47:12.265
Of course!

544
47:15.745 --> 47:17.705
Give me a second. I'll be right back.

545
47:19.545 --> 47:21.625
-Yeah, I'll be right back too. -Uh-huh.

546
47:27.545 --> 47:29.865
Hey, the power's out.

547
47:29.945 --> 47:30.865
Ow!

548
47:31.905 --> 47:34.465
Hey, Rin! Are you okay?

549
47:35.065 --> 47:39.425
Happy birthday to you

550
47:39.505 --> 47:44.105
-Happy birthday to you -Happy birthday to you

551
47:44.185 --> 47:49.065
-Happy birthday, happy birthday -Happy birthday, happy birthday

552
47:50.105 --> 47:56.985
-Happy birthday to you -Happy birthday to you

553
47:59.225 --> 48:00.465
Happy birthday.

554
48:01.585 --> 48:03.265
Make a wish and blow out the candles.

555
48:26.545 --> 48:30.385
May you always have good luck, my boyfriend.

556
48:35.265 --> 48:37.265
How sweet!

557
48:54.625 --> 48:56.225
Still not done filming for your client?

558
48:56.305 --> 48:57.305
Not yet.

559
49:00.785 --> 49:02.065
Why did you bring the guitar?

560
49:03.345 --> 49:04.425
I'm giving it back.

561
49:05.105 --> 49:09.025
But I didn't win, so there's no prize money.

562
49:10.065 --> 49:11.225
You don't have to give it back.

563
49:12.265 --> 49:13.505
Go on.

564
49:13.585 --> 49:14.545
Keep it.

565
49:20.945 --> 49:23.825
Hey, when did you buy a ring?

566
49:30.945 --> 49:32.985
You keep making me play an F chord.

567
49:36.025 --> 49:37.145
Can I move forward?

568
49:37.905 --> 49:39.025
What's that supposed to mean?

569
49:46.985 --> 49:48.705
I want to try other chords.

570
49:48.785 --> 49:53.185
F-A-N.

571
49:54.145 --> 49:55.745
That spells "boyfriend" in Thai.

572
50:03.105 --> 50:04.425
Will you be my boyfriend?

573
50:13.785 --> 50:14.945
Yeah.

574
50:24.025 --> 50:24.985
Thank you.

575
50:28.025 --> 50:31.465
I'm sorry I kept you waiting so long.

576
50:32.065 --> 50:33.545
I thought I'd never hear

577
50:35.225 --> 50:37.105
you say those words in this lifetime.

578
51:29.105 --> 51:31.265
Now you're being cute.

579
51:38.185 --> 51:41.825
If it weren't for the owl, would we be holding each other like this?

580
51:47.145 --> 51:48.185
What?

581
51:57.505 --> 52:00.425
This bracelet means a lot to me.

582
52:01.145 --> 52:03.785
I've entrusted it to you. Don't take it off again, okay?

583
52:17.025 --> 52:18.305
I won't take it off again.

584
52:21.105 --> 52:26.145
So, do you remember who gave this to you now?

585
52:28.585 --> 52:29.665
Of course I do.

586
52:30.665 --> 52:32.585
He's the person who changed my life.

587
52:36.105 --> 52:40.065
You changed my life too.

588
52:41.665 --> 52:42.865
Thank you.

589
52:44.025 --> 52:44.865
Yeah.

590
52:50.105 --> 52:51.785
So, where's my birthday present?

591
52:53.625 --> 52:55.385
I already gave it to you. The cake.

592
52:55.465 --> 52:56.985
A cake is a cake.

593
52:57.065 --> 52:58.305
A present is a present.

594
52:59.625 --> 53:00.985
Then what do you want?

595
53:02.065 --> 53:04.065
Well…

596
53:11.905 --> 53:14.185
That's not enough. This side too.

597
53:19.145 --> 53:20.665
Happy now?

598
53:22.385 --> 53:23.545
Should I be?

599
53:26.545 --> 53:28.585
What was that spell you used to curse me?

600
53:31.945 --> 53:33.825
A presto amora.

601
53:34.425 --> 53:37.185
Can you curse me again?

602
53:38.825 --> 53:40.545
Make us love each other forever.

603
53:41.545 --> 53:42.625
You idiot.

604
53:43.985 --> 53:45.025
Are you serious?

605
53:45.105 --> 53:46.105
I'm serious.

606
53:46.185 --> 53:47.825
Come on. I'm ready.

607
53:51.865 --> 53:55.385
A presto amora!

608
54:00.425 --> 54:02.185
I think the curse already works.

609
54:03.625 --> 54:04.865
Can I kiss you?

610
54:06.145 --> 54:07.785
I don't think it's the curse talking.

611
54:09.105 --> 54:11.345
If you don't answer, I'll do more than kiss you.

612
54:49.625 --> 54:50.825
What are you doing?

613
54:51.665 --> 54:52.905
Khobfa!

614
54:53.785 --> 54:54.985
You!

615
54:55.665 --> 54:56.865
Take that!

616
54:58.265 --> 54:59.745
That tickles!

617
54:59.825 --> 55:00.865
Let go!

618
55:03.225 --> 55:04.665
Whoa! I'm falling off the bed.

619
55:15.345 --> 55:16.585
Seriously, Rin.

620
55:16.665 --> 55:17.745
When did you make that vow?

621
55:17.825 --> 55:20.665
Back when we were still terrible at playing together,

622
55:20.745 --> 55:22.305
I didn't know what else to do.

623
55:22.385 --> 55:25.665
I turned to the spiritual power for help. Then we unlocked these gold-tier skills.

624
55:26.945 --> 55:31.065
So you're saying we're this good not because we practiced our asses off?

625
55:31.945 --> 55:34.025
Come on, you're good too.

626
55:38.105 --> 55:41.145
-Amen! -Amen!

627
55:45.305 --> 55:46.625
